  {
    "model": "blog.blog",
    "pk": 4,
    "fields": {
      "author": 2,
      "category": 3,
      "title": "Установка любой версии Python на Debian",
      "content": "<p>Установим необходимые зависимости:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo apt update &amp;&amp; sudo apt install -y wget build-essential libncursesw5-dev libreadline-dev \\</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">libssl-dev libsqlite3-dev libgdbm-dev libc6-dev libbz2-dev libffi-dev zlib1g-dev \\</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">liblzma-dev uuid-dev tk-dev</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">Скачаем и установим. В данной статье рассматривается версия python 3.12.3</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">cd /usr/src</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo wget https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.12.3/Python-3.12.3.tgz</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo tar -xf Python-3.12.3.tgz</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo rm Python-3.12.3.tgz # &larr; удаление архива</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">cd Python-3.12.3</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo ./configure --enable-optimizations</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo make -j$(nproc)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">sudo make altinstall</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">Проверка установленной версии:</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">python3.12 --version</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>",
      "preview": "blog/originals/Python-logo-notext.svg.png",
      "preview_mobile": "blog/mobile/Python-logo-notext.svg_mobile.webp",
      "preview_tablet": "blog/tablets/Python-logo-notext.svg_tablet.webp",
      "preview_desktop": "blog/desktop/Python-logo-notext.svg_desktop.webp",
